    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for that. For the polished concrete, what specific kind of surface damage or degradation should I be looking out for over a 5-10 year period? Like, what actually causes the surface to lose its finish or get pitted? I want to make sure I can explain the long-term risks to the client.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
